# English-Only Code Comments

All comments in source code must be written in English — inline comments, block comments, and JSDoc/TSDoc alike.

```typescript
// ❌ BAD
// Benutzer aus der Datenbank laden
const user = await db.findUser(id);

// ✅ GOOD
// Load user from database
const user = await db.findUser(id);
```

This rule does **not** apply to:
- User-facing UI strings
- Documentation files (`.md`, `.mdc`)
- Git commit messages

The language of every other control artifact (rules, skills, entry files, Jira) is governed by `general-language-policy`; this rule is its code-comment subset.
